acceptance_criteria: Add red-first CLI/runtime contract coverage; return valid JSON with all existing duplicate result fields; declare applicable universal controls in the capability registry; preserve bounded default TOON and read-only behavior; cover CLI and SDK action parity.
parent: pm-5t33or
severity: medium
repro_steps: Run pm duplicates --since 2026-08-20 --output-format json on 2026.8.21; observe universal-output refusal despite successful structured TOON output without the flag.
resolution: "Resolved: duplicates exposes the universal read-output contract and explicitly maps legacy --limit to the amount dimension across SDK and generated contracts."
expected_result: "CLI and SDK duplicate reads publish applicable dimensions, stable receipts, and legacy amount migration metadata while preserving bounded TOON defaults."
actual_result: Focused receipt coverage passes; generated contracts are current; zero duplication is recorded; changelog traceability is linked.
